
	;Constants for Jester.per

;CONSTANTS

	;new ai updates from game updates (January)

; sn-gate-type-for-wall ( 1 = palisade gate , 0 = stone or fortified gates)
;flares can be found using players-unit-type-count and up-find-flare
; up-find-flare now finds flare objects
; (strategic-number sn-disable-villager-garrison 3) now stops boar-lurers from garrisoning
; sn-minimum-number-hunters now properly assigns villagers to huntable objects.
;sn-object-repair-level now takes scorpion and trebuchet units into consideration
; new defconsts for the Last Khans Civs
; maximum amount of strategic numbers from 303 -> 511.
; up-can-build no longer returns false when using wall objects.
; up-garrison now accepts unit lines, and now works on distant targets.
; up-gather-inside now works on watch towers.
; up-path-distance and up-get-path-distance updated.
; find-random with up-find player now returns correct player ID's.
; additional bug fixes.

	;August 2021
;Wall objects are now being detected when using position-target, position-focus or position-enemy.
;Fixed an issue with up-chat-data-to-player and up-chat-data-to-player-using-id where they did not always output chat to the intended player.

